      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ceng’ maeca kulo m’udhenyni biyabre ni ot pa Daudi man ni ju m’ubedo i Yerusalem, pi dubo man pi cilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ebitimbre i ceng’ maeca, Yehova mir udul uwacu, nia abithumo nying’ mungu m’araga woko kud i ng’om e jubipoi pigi kendo ngo; man abiwodho jubila ku tipo m’ucido bende woko kud i ng’om. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ebitimbre nia, ka ng’atu moko biewo lembe asu, won ku min m’unyole bilund wacu ire kumae, Ibibedo kwo ngo; kum iyero ndra i nying’ Yehova; man won ku min m’unyole gibicobe plu kan eewo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ebitimbre i ceng’ maeca, nia lewic binego jubila kubang’gi nzu kum ginmawokiwang’, kan eewo; kadok kanzu mi yuklim gibikendo ngo kara gibomb abombi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ento ebiwacu kumae, An a jabila ngo, an a jatipodho; kum judwoka ni ng’eca ugambre m’a nyathin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ng’atu acel biwacu ire kumae, Poyo maeni ma kind cingi en e ang’o? Ebilund dwoko lembe kumae, Maeni poyo mi rem ma junyayu i kuma i ot mi jurimba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
