            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.26.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 26:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.14.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 14:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ceu, E palamularu, kum jakwac para, man kum ng’atu ma wada, Yehova mir udul uwacu: wugoi jakwac, e rombe bilal; e abiloko cinga wi ju ma thindho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ebitimbre, nia i ng’om ceke, Yehova wacu, ng’ete ario ma ni i ie bithumbre woko man bitho; ento mir adege bidong’ i ie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man abikelo ng’ete mir adege i mac, e abidwokogi leng’ calu judwoko mola ma tar leng’, man abiponjogi calu juponjo mola ma kwar. Gibilwong’o nyinga, man abiwinjogi: abiwacu kumae, En e dhanu para; man gibiwacu kumae, Yehova en e Mungu para.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
